title: Inter-Party Relationships
new-page: true
view-if: b_inter_party_relationships_timer <= 0 and player_party = "b"
is-card: true
on-arrival: inter_party_relationships_timer += 4; week_actions += 1
card-image: img/portraits/taburin_b_m.jpg
tags: b_party

= Inter-Party Relationships

We can improve our relations with the other democratic or socialist parties.

- @anarchists
- @lsr
- @sr
- @mensheviks
- @kadets 
- @internationalists
- @moderates
- @root: We do not need to improve our relations.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action


@anarchists
title: Anarchists & Maximalists — Improve our relations. 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and anarchists_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if anarchists_legal != 1: We have banned these groups. ?]
on-arrival: anarchist_relation += 8*(1-b_dissent); maximalist_relation += 8*(1-b_dissent); b_resources -= 1;

We have improved our relations with the anarchists and maximalists. 


@lsr
title: Left-SRs — Improve our relations. 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and lsr_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if lsr_legal != 1: We have banned this party. ?]
on-arrival: lsr_relation += 8*(1-b_dissent); b_resources -= 1;

We have improved our relations with the Left-SRs. 


@sr
title: SRs — Can we repair relations with them as a whole?
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and sr_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if sr_legal != 1: We have banned these parties. ?]
on-arrival:{!
Q.b_resources -= 1;
Q.moderate_dissent -= 3;
Q.moderate_strength += 3;
Q.leninist_dissent += 3;
Q.leftcom_dissent += 2;
Q.lsr_relation += 3 * (1 - Q.b_dissent);
Q.centre_sr_relation += 3 + Math.max(
    0,
    (6 * (1 - Q.b_dissent))
    - Math.max(0, (Q.leninist_strength / Q.moderate_strength))
    + Math.max(0, (Q.moderate_strength / Q.leninist_strength))
);
Q.right_sr_relation += 3 + Math.max(
    0,
    (4 * (1 - Q.b_dissent))
    - Math.max(0, (Q.leninist_strength / Q.moderate_strength))
    + Math.max(0, (Q.moderate_strength / Q.leninist_strength))
);
Q.right_sr_strength -= 3;
!}

Appealing to the SRs is unexpected, but welcome by those in favor of conciliationism on either side. [? if leninist_strength >= moderate_strength : The influence of Lenin however makes it difficult for us to make further in-roads. ?]


@mensheviks
title: Mensheviks — Can we repair relations with them? 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and mensheviks_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if mensheviks_legal != 1: We have banned these parties. ?]
on-arrival: b_resources -= 1; moderate_dissent -= 3; moderate_strength += 3; leninist_dissent += 3; leftcom_dissent += 2; sdi_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(10*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); left_m_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); left_m_strength += 3; centre_m_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); right_m_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(4*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength)));  right_m_strength -= 3; 


Appealing to the Mensheviks is unexpected, but welcome by those in favor of conciliationism on either side. [? if leninist_strength >= moderate_strength : The influence of Lenin however makes it difficult for us to make further in-roads. ?]

@kadets
title: Kadets — Is there any point appealing to them? 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and kadets_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if kadets_legal != 1: We have banned this party. ?]
on-arrival: b_resources -= 1; moderate_dissent -= 1; moderate_strength += 2; leninist_dissent += 20; leninist_strength -= 2; leftcom_dissent += 10; leftcom_strength += 2; k_relation += 1 + Math.max(0,(1*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength)) - (instability/50));

Reaching out to the Kadets shocks both their members and our own. Given our past history, it seems we struggle to make any progress. 

@internationalists
title: Reach out to all internationalists. 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and parties_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if parties_legal != 1: We have banned all other parties. ?]
on-arrival: b_resources -= 1; moderate_dissent -= 3; moderate_strength += 3; leninist_dissent += 3; leftcom_dissent -= 2; leftcom_strength += 2; sdi_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(12*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); left_m_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(10*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); left_m_strength += 2; centre_m_relation += 2 + Math.max(0,(3*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); lsr_relation += 6*(1-b_dissent); anarchist_relation += 5*(1-b_dissent); maximalist_relation += 5*(1-b_dissent); centre_sr_relation += 2 + Math.max(0,(3*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); right_sr_strength -= 2; right_m_relation -= 2; right_sr_relation -= 2; ns_relation -= 2; 


Appeals for a just and immediate peace resonate among fellow internationalists. [? if leninist_strength >= moderate_strength : The influence of Lenin however makes it difficult for us to make further in-roads. ?]

@moderates
title: In these trying times, we must seek to repair relations with all fellow socialists. 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and parties_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if parties_legal != 1: We have banned all other parties. ?]
on-arrival: b_resources -= 1; moderate_dissent -= 5; moderate_strength += 5; leninist_dissent += 8; leninist_strength -= 4; leftcom_dissent += 2; anarchist_relation += 3*(1-b_dissent); maximalist_relation += 3*(1-b_dissent); sdi_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); left_m_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); left_m_strength += 3; centre_m_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); right_m_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength)));  right_m_strength -= 3; lsr_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); centre_sr_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); right_sr_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); right_sr_strength -= 3; ns_relation += 3 + Math.max(0,(6*(1-b_dissent)) - Math.max(0,(leninist_strength/moderate_strength)) + Math.max(0,(moderate_strength/leninist_strength))); right_sr_strength -= 3; 


Our overtures to the other socialists parties is unexpected, by welcome by moderates on either side. [? if leninist_strength >= moderate_strength : The influence of Lenin however makes it difficult for us to make further in-roads. ?]


 
